ith diabetes and high blood pressure in northern Nigeria?\\",\\n  \\"How can I integrate my passion for storytelling into educational diabetes awareness sessions in my Hausa community?\\",\\n  \\"Are there community walking groups or safe outdoor exercise spaces for women near suburban Kano?\\",\\n  \\"How does fasting during Ramadan affect blood sugar management for diabetic Muslim women in Kano?\\",\\n  \\"What advice do local healthcare clinics in Kano give to Hausa women on balancing work, exercise, and religious activities for better health?\\"\\n]", "relevant_profile_info": "", "selected_profile_info": [null, "culture", "city_town", "religion", "name", "gender", "age", "describe_location", "describe_food", "disability", "occupation", "daily_routine", "hobbies", "activities", "health_conditions", "medication", "healthcare_resources", "healthcare_access", "healthcare_frequency", "t2d_status", "tobacco", "alcohol", "physical_activity", "diet_restrictions", "support_network", "Question", "generated_queries", "Category", "study_number", "health_goals", "output_format", "label", "story_arc", "type", "parent", "output_tone"]}
