lished feel.", "Morning sounds on the farm include birdsongs and the gentle clipping of coffee branches; Kamau Mwangi's tone is more confident and upbeat as he shares progress; his brother's laughter and encouragement come from nearby, creating a warm, motivating atmosphere."], "image_prompts": ["Kamau Mwangi, a young Kikuyu male coffee farmer, stands holding a half-eaten mandazi near his modest suburban home in Kiambu; late morning light highlights the texture of his worn shirt and the rustic background of coffee bushes, his posture shows slight fatigue and puzzlement.", "Kamau Mwangi listens attentively to a female nurse inside a brightly lit local health clinic in Kiambu; medium shot captures Kamau seated with a thoughtful expression while the nurse points to a simple health poster, natural daylight filters through the window, creating a calm atmosphere.", "Kamau Mwangi attempts to peel roasted groundnuts while sitting under a tree on his coffee farm, the sun casting dappled shadows through the leaves; his brows furrow slightly as he hesitates, holding a small handful of peanuts, reflecting the struggle to change habits, medium shot.", "Kamau Mwangi is confidently pruning coffee plants with his brother early in the morning, bright sunrise lighting their hopeful faces and the lush green coffee bushes; wide shot shows their teamwork and renewed energy, Kamau standing upright with a focused smile."], "language_code": "en-KE", "avg_time_taken": 3.350223708152771, "task_parent_id": "", "audio_gen_model": "Azure Speech", "image_gen_model": "flux", "generated_queries": "[\\n  \\"What are some effective ways for a young Anglican Kikuyu coffee farmer from Kiambu to stay motivated in managing type 2 diabetes?\\",\\n  \\"Are there any fitness groups or community exercise activities near Kiambu for young adults with diabetes?\\",\\n  \\"How can I incorporate traditional Kikuyu foods into a healthy vegetarian diet for diabetes management?\\",\\n  \\"What are some practical ex