ot, natural light, vibrant colors, Wanjiku Mwangi in the center.", "Wanjiku Mwangi cooking a healthy meal in her kitchen, with a proud expression, close-up shot, warm lighting, earthy colors, Wanjiku Mwangi's hands and food in focus.", "Wanjiku Mwangi delivering produce to the nearby market, with a confident and happy expression, wide shot, natural light, bright colors, Wanjiku Mwangi in the foreground, with a beautiful landscape in the background."], "language_code": "en-KE", "avg_time_taken": 13.226420080661773, "task_parent_id": "b8cbd84a-30d0-4385-abd3-771dda1e987b", "audio_gen_model": "Azure Speech", "image_gen_model": "flux", "generated_queries": "[\\n  \\"What are affordable, healthy Kikuyu traditional foods suitable for someone with type 2 diabetes living in rural Murangâ€™a, Kenya?\\",\\n  \\"How can young female agro-business owners in Kenyan rural areas like Murangâ€™a maintain a balanced diet while managing high alcohol consumption?\\",\\n  \\"What are some cost-effective ways to follow a Kosher diet using locally available foods in Murangâ€™a province?\\",\\n  \\"Are there community groups or organizations in Murangâ€™a that support young women living alone with diabetes in healthy eating and exercise?\\",\\n  \\"How can volleyball and other physical activities help manage blood sugar for a Kikuyu woman with type 2 diabetes?\\",\\n  \\"Which local clinics or hospitals in small rural communities offer diabetes nutrition counseling tailored to Christian (Zion Christian Church) cultural values?\\",\\n  \\"Can I find recipes for healthy, budget-friendly Kikuyu meals that follow Kosher guidelines and are suitable for someone with type 2 diabetes?\\",\\n  \\"What are the common challenges faced by rural Kenyan agro-business owners in maintaining a nutritious diet, and how can they overcome them?\\",\\n  \\"Is there any guidance for balancing alcohol consumption with diabetes management in rural Kenyan settings, especially for women aged 18â€“24?\\",\\n  \\"What seasonal fruits and vegetables are affordable and accessible in Murangâ€™a for a diabetic-friendly, Kosher diet?\\",\\n  \\"How do lifestyle changes alone (no medication) compare to using traditional herbal medicines for managing type 2 diabetes among Kikuyu women in rural Kenya?\\",\\n  \\"Are there tips for solo young women in rural Kenya to build a support network for diabetes management and healthy living?\\"\\n]", "relevant_profile_info": "", "selected_profile_info": [null, "city_town", "religion", "name", "gender", "age", "describe_location", "describe_food", "disability", "occupation", "daily_routine", "hobbies", "activities", "health_conditions", "medication", "healthcare_resources", "healthcare_access", "healthcare_frequency", "culture", "t2d_status", "tobacco", "alcohol", "physical_activity", "diet_restrictions", "support_network", "Question", "generated_queries", "Category", "study_number", "health_goals", "output_format", "label", "story_arc", "type", "parent", "output_tone"]}
