ffectively manage diabetes and hypertension?\\",\\n  \\"How can family-based support in Kikuyu culture help improve adherence to a healthy lifestyle for women dealing with hypertension and diabetes?\\",\\n  \\"What are trusted sources or platforms in Kenya to learn about lactose-free diet recipes using locally available foods?\\"\\n]", "relevant_profile_info": "", "selected_profile_info": ["city_town", "religion", "name", "gender", "describe_location", "describe_food", "disability", "daily_routine", "health_conditions", "medication", "healthcare_frequency", "culture", "physical_activity", "support_network", "Question", "generated_queries", "Category", "study_number", "output_format", "label", "story_arc", "type", "parent", "output_tone"]}
