someone who drinks daily?\\",\\n  \\"Which healthcare clinics or hospitals in Kisumu offer specialized diabetes education for young adults?\\",\\n  \\"How does late-night eating impact blood sugar control according to local Kisumu healthcare professionals for vegetarian diabetics?\\",\\n  \\"Are there online or community resources in Kisumu that provide personalized diet plans for vegetarian Luo women with type 2 diabetes?\\"\\n]", "relevant_profile_info": "My name is Awino Opondi, and I'm a 22-year-old Luo fisherwoman living in Kisumu, Kenya. I love my job, but it can be physically demanding. When I'm not fishing, I enjoy dancing Ohangla with my friends. However, I've noticed that my energy levels have been low lately, and I've been getting headaches more frequently. I've been eating a lot of sugary foods and drinks to keep my energy up, but I know that's not the best choice for my health. I've also been drinking alcohol daily, which I know isn't good for me either. I've been putting off going to the doctor because I don't want to hear that I need to change my habits. But I know I need to make some changes if I want to stay healthy and perform well at work.", "selected_profile_info": [null, "city_town", "religion", "name", "gender", "age", "describe_location", "describe_food", "disability", "occupation", "daily_routine", "hobbies", "activities", "health_conditions", "medication", "healthcare_resources", "healthcare_access", "healthcare_frequency", "culture", "t2d_status", "tobacco", "alcohol", "physical_activity", "diet_restrictions", "support_network", "Question", "generated_queries", "Category", "study_number", "health_goals", "output_format", "label", "story_arc", "type", "parent", "output_tone"]}
