ling of leaves and footfalls; audio perspective positioned near Mark.", "Morning market sounds with vendor calls lively and cheerful; Mark Otieno’s voice confident and warm as he shares his success story; sounds of fish moving in baskets, light footsteps and distant children laughing; general bustling market ambiance; microphone near Mark’s position."], "image_prompts": ["Mark Otieno, an elderly Luo man, stands outside a simple fish stall in Migori town market holding a heavy bucket of fresh fish with a strained, tired expression; dusty ground and busy market stalls in background; late afternoon natural lighting; candid medium shot.", "Mark Otieno listens attentively to a female Nigerian English-speaking female nurse in a local Migori clinic; nurse holds a pamphlet with exercise illustrations; simple clinic room with posters on the wall; soft daylight through window; candid medium shot.", "Mark Otieno attempts squats near his modest compound with a small garden patch behind; his facial expression shows mild struggle but determined posture; evening light casting long shadows; natural unposed candid medium shot.", "Mark Otieno proudly carries a basket of fish with a confident smile at busy Migori town fish market; vibrant market stalls and customers visible behind; warm morning sunlight; candid wide shot."], "language_code": "en-KE", "avg_time_taken": 3.10124871134758, "task_parent_id": "a6c0ffc7-02ac-4edf-b80a-d26f1d048f15", "audio_gen_model": "Azure Speech", "image_gen_model": "flux", "generated_queries": "[\\n  \\"What are healthy Kenyan urban Luo cuisine options in Migori suitable for someone with type 2 diabetes and hypertension?\\",\\n  \\"How does daily alcohol consumption impact blood sugar control in older male fish traders with diabetes in Migori town?\\",\\n  \\"Are there community programs or church groups in Migori urban areas that support older adults like me (65+) with managing diabetes?\\",\\n  \\"What time should I eat my last meal in the evening to manage late-night blood sugar spikes, considering my routine as a fish trader in urban Migori?\\",\\n  \\"Which local Migori vegetables or animal products used in Luo tradition could help with hypertension and diabetes management?\\",\\n  \\"How can a male, 65+, who works as a fish trader and enjoys farming in Kenyan urban settings optimize physical activity for better blood sugar control?\\",\\n  \\"What are the benefits or risks of using herbal or traditional Luo medicines for diabetes and hypertension alongside insulin and metformin?\\",\\n  \\"Are there Migori urban healthcare clinics experienced in supporting elderly diabetic patients who are also on a kosher diet?\\",\\n  \\"Which end-of-day activities, common among urban Luo men, might help reduce the urge for late-night eating while socializing with family or friends?\\",\\n  \\"How does easy access to healthy foods in Migori town influence the management of both hypertension and diabetes for urban senior men?\\",\\n  \\"Are there special dietary adjustments for managing diabetes if I keep kosher and live in Migori with access to local fish and agricultural produce?\\",\\n  \\"What steps can someone my age (65+) take to reduce night-time snacking, aligned with Luo cultural practices in Migori urban areas?\\"\\n]", "relevant_profile_info": "I'm Mark Otieno, a 65-year-old Luo man living and working in Migori town. Every day, I wake up early to go fish trading at the local market. After a long day, I usually enjoy some farming and looking after my animals at home. I take my insulin shots and metformin to manage my diabetes and hypertension, but sometimes I eat late at night or skip certain activities because I think my body can handle it. I don't really have a gym or fancy equipment, so I just go about my business the way I always have, not really thinking much about how my daily habits might affect my blood sugar or blood pressure.", "selected_profile_info": [null, "city_town", "religion", "name", "gender", "age", "describe_location", "describe_food", "disability", "occupation", "daily_routine", "hobbies", "activities", "health_conditions", "medication", "healthcare_resources", "healthcare_access", "healthcare_frequency", "culture", "t2d_status", "tobacco", "alcohol", "physical_activity", "diet_restrictions", "support_network", "Question", "generated_queries", "Category", "study_number", "health_goals", "output_format", "label", "story_arc", "type", "parent", "output_tone"]}
