er).\\n  Resistance is mild and based on uncertainty.\\n  Advice is clear, simple, personalized, culturally relevant, actionable, and practical.\\n  {max_word_count}\\n\\n- **Paragraph 3:**\\n  The persona attempts the advice but struggles with **adjusting routines**.\\n  A minor setback occurs due to habit change.\\n  They persist because of the upcoming larger task.\\n  {max_word_count}\\n\\n- **Paragraph 4:**\\n  Gradual, realistic improvement occurs.\\n  The larger task is accomplished with more confidence.\\n  The persona becomes open to continued health improvement.\\n  {max_word_count}", "language": "en", "story_arc": "resistance", "audio_prompts": ["A recording of Mkena Otieno, a Luo woman in her 20s, speaking in a soft voice. She is talking about her struggles with diabetes and her new diet. The background is a quiet kitchen. Mkena sounds tired and worried.", "A recording of Mkena Otieno, a Luo woman in her 20s, speaking in a determined voice. She is talking about her new diet and her plan to exercise regularly. The background is a busy market. Mkena sounds confident and energetic.", "A recording of Mkena Otieno, a Luo woman in her 20s, speaking in a slightly worried voice. She is talking about her struggles with adjusting to her new diet. The background is a quiet garden. Mkena sounds slightly frustrated.", "A recording of Mkena Otieno, a Luo woman in her 20s, speaking in a happy voice. She is talking about her progress and her newfound confidence. The background is a colorful market. Mkena sounds joyful and enthusiastic."], "image_prompts": ["A photo of Mkena Otieno, a Luo woman in her 20s, sitting on a bench, looking tired and holding a plate of ugali and fish. The background is a small kitchen in a rural area. Mkena is wearing a simple dress and has a worried expression on her face.", "A photo of Mkena Otieno, a Luo woman in her 20s, standing in a kitchen, holding a basket of vegetables. The background is a colorful market stall. Mkena is wearing a bright dress and has a determined expression on her face.", "A photo of Mkena Otieno, a Luo woman in her 20s, sitting on a bench, looking tired and holding a plate of vegetables. The background is a small garden. Mkena is wearing a simple dress and has a slightly worried expression on her face.", "A photo of Mkena Otieno, a Luo woman in her 20s, standing in a kitchen, holding a plate of vegetables and smiling. The background is a colorful market stall. Mkena is wearing a bright dress and has a confident expression on her face."], "language_code": "en-KE", "avg_time_taken": 6.7692919300823675, "task_parent_id": "", "audio_gen_model": "Azure Speech", "image_gen_model": "flux", "generated_queries": "[\\n  \\"What are the best vegetarian traditional Luo recipes suitable for someone with type 2 diabetes living in Siaya, Kenya?\\",\\n  \\"Where can I find affordable fresh vegetables and healthy food options for vegetarians in urban areas of Siaya County with limited access to healthy foods?\\",\\n  \\"Are there any community support groups for young women with diabetes in Siaya, especially among the Luo people?\\",\\n  \\"How can I incorporate Ohangla dancing safely into my exercise routine as a fish processor with type 2 diabetes?\\",\\n  \\"What are the most effective exercise routines for women aged 25-34 with diabetes who haven't been physically active in Siayaâ€™s urban areas?\\",\\n  \\"Are there any local clinics or hospitals in Siaya town that offer diabetes-specific counseling or education for Christians?\\",\\n  \\"How does weekly tobacco smoking and high alcohol consumption impact blood sugar management for Luo women with type 2 diabetes?\\",\\n  \\"Can I find safe walking routes or public parks in Siaya urban area suitable for regular exercise?\\",\\n  \\"How do cultural beliefs among Luo Christians in Siaya influence diabetes management and medication adherence?\\",\\n  \\"What local social or religious community events for women in Siaya support healthy lifestyles or diabetes awareness?\\",\\n  \\"As a fish processor in urban Kenya, what occupational health risks should I consider if I have diabetes and limited access to healthy foods?\\",\\n  \\"Are there success stories of young Luo women reversing or better managing type 2 diabetes through lifestyle changes in Siaya County?\\"\\n]", "relevant_profile_info": "", "selected_profile_info": [null, "city_town", "religion", "name", "gender", "age", "describe_location", "describe_food", "disability", "occupation", "daily_routine", "hobbies", "activities", "health_conditions", "medication", "healthcare_resources", "healthcare_access", "healthcare_frequency", "culture", "t2d_status", "tobacco", "alcohol", "physical_activity", "diet_restrictions", "support_network", "Question", "generated_queries", "Category", "study_number", "health_goals", "output_format", "label", "story_arc", "type", "parent", "output_tone"]}
