ality", "Jared Otieno, a 65-year-old Luo man, speaks to Amina, a mid-50s nurse, nearby, voice clear and calm, saying 'I don’t feel strong,' with a slight hesitation, background sound of a soft beep from a monitor, distant church bell, moderate volume, moderate speed, mid-range natural pitch, smooth and flowing fluency, warm and inviting tone, slightly put-upon emotion, clear articulation", "Jared Otieno, a 65-year-old Luo man, walks slowly on a dusty path, breathing deeply, voice soft and slow, saying 'I can’t do this' with a slight pause, then 'I must try again,' background sound of wind, water dripping from a stone, distant children playing, volume soft, moderate speed, mid-range natural pitch, slightly strained texture, genuine emotion, warm and inviting tone", "Jared Otieno, a 65-year-old Luo man, stands in front of children playing ajua, speaking clearly, saying 'When you move, your body feels better,' with a warm smile, background sound of children laughing, the game of ajua with stones, light music from a radio, volume moderate, slow and deliberate pace, mid-range natural pitch, clear and distinct articulation, warm and inviting tone, cheerful personality"], "image_prompts": ["Jared Otieno, a 65-year-old Luo man, sits on a wooden bench in a small backyard with a low fence, wearing a faded blue shirt and faded trousers, his hands resting on his knees, looking tired, while a pile of vegetables lies nearby in a woven basket, sunlight filtering through the leaves above, dust on the wooden floor, grass growing between the stones, a small pot of porridge on a stone table, natural lighting, soft shadows, detail in the texture of the fabric and soil", "Jared Otieno, a 65-year-old Luo man, stands beside a woman named Amina, a mid-50s nurse in a white uniform with a red badge, both in a clinic waiting room, Amina gently pointing to a chart on a wooden table, Jared looking slightly unsure, sunlight from a window behind them, the room has a few chairs, a small sign that 