"Amahle Mahlangu, breathing heavily, with a determined tone, saying \\"I can do this\\", with a background sound of footsteps, and birds chirping.", "Amahle Mahlangu, laughing, with a happy tone, saying \\"I'm taking control of my health\\", with a background sound of a football game, and people cheering."], "image_prompts": ["Amahle Mahlangu, a 35-44 year old female, sitting at a desk, looking tired and sluggish, with a stack of papers and a cup of sugary tea in front of her, medium shot.", "Amahle Mahlangu, sitting in a clinic, listening to a healthcare provider, a female, who is explaining something to her, with a concerned expression, wide shot.", "Amahle Mahlangu, walking in a park, looking determined, with a water bottle in her hand, and a few leaves of kale in her pocket, medium shot.", "Amahle Mahlangu, standing in her backyard, smiling, surrounded by a small garden of leafy greens and herbs, with a football in the background, wide shot."], "language_code": "en-ZA", "avg_time_taken": 5.6488824540918525, "task_parent_id": "", "audio_gen_model": "Azure Speech", "image_gen_model": "flux", "generated_queries": "[\\n  \\"What are some effective exercise options for women with type 2 diabetes who live in urban Eastern Cape, South Africa, and prefer not to go to the gym?\\",\\n  \\"Are there gluten-free traditional IsiXhosa foods I can include in my diet to help manage diabetes?\\",\\n  \\"What Baptist church community groups or support resources exist in Eastern Cape for adults with diabetes?\\",\\n  \\"How can a working female teacher in Eastern Cape integrate regular physical activity into a busy daily routine?\\",\\n  \\"What are safe ways for daily tobacco smokers with type 2 diabetes to gradually reduce or quit smoking in South Africa?\\",\\n  \\"How does daily alcohol consumption impact blood sugar control for women in their late 30s to early 40s with type 2 diabetes?\\",\\n  \\"Where can I find reliable diabetes education programs or workshops offered in Is