ocate for diabetes management or active lifestyles?\\",\\n  \\"What practical ways can I use household items in my Homa Bay apartment for resistance training or cardio workouts?\\",\\n  \\"How can I balance my radio presenting job and diabetes management given my easy access to healthy foods but limited gym access?\\",\\n  \\"Are there support groups or diabetes education sessions at local healthcare clinics or hospitals in urban Homa Bay?\\",\\n  \\"What are affordable options for purchasing lactose-free products in urban areas of Homa Bay?\\",\\n  \\"How does the urban lifestyle in Homa Bay impact daily physical activity habits for young adults with type 2 diabetes?\\"\\n]", "relevant_profile_info": "", "selected_profile_info": [null, "city_town", "religion", "name", "gender", "age", "describe_location", "describe_food", "disability", "occupation", "daily_routine", "hobbies", "activities", "health_conditions", "medication", "healthcare_resources", "healthcare_access", "healthcare_frequency", "culture", "t2d_status", "tobacco", "alcohol", "physical_activity", "diet_restrictions", "support_network", "Question", "generated_queries", "Category", "study_number", "health_goals", "output_format", "label", "story_arc", "type", "parent", "output_tone"]}
