g from Litha Mthembu and a close friend practicing dance steps in a sunny yard, voices joyful and warm, slight panting from exertion, birds chirping brightly in the distance, ambient sounds of urban life faintly present, recorded in medium proximity."], "image_prompts": ["Litha Mthembu, an elderly IsiXhosa woman wearing a simple colorful skirt and blouse, sitting tiredly on a wooden chair outside her modest urban Eastern Cape home, holding her hands on her lap, with a quiet street background in soft afternoon light, her posture reflecting fatigue and reflection, medium shot.", "Nurse Thandi, a South African female nurse in a clinic uniform, standing and gently explaining exercise steps to Litha Mthembu, who listens attentively with slight uncertainty, inside a brightly lit local healthcare clinic in the Eastern Cape, with health posters on the walls, medium shot.", "Litha Mthembu slowly walking around a paved sidewalk block in her neighborhood in the early morning, dressed in comfortable walking clothes, hands slightly swinging, showing determination but slight discomfort, with a background of modest urban houses, wide shot.", "Litha Mthembu smiling broadly, mid-dance step of traditional umxhentso in her yard wearing a vibrant patterned dress, with a close friend joining her laughing, under warm golden afternoon sunlight, their movements captured naturally, medium shot."], "language_code": "en-ZA", "avg_time_taken": 5.38300901055336, "task_parent_id": "05216f3a-8933-4136-a86e-2da30a593994", "audio_gen_model": "Azure Speech", "image_gen_model": "flux", "generated_queries": "[\\n  \\"What are some IsiXhosa traditional foods available in Eastern Cape cities that are suitable for a 65+ year old female with type 2 diabetes and hypertension?\\",\\n  \\"Where can I find urban dance groups or events for umxhentso or intlombe in the Eastern Cape suitable for seniors who do not exercise regularly?\\",\\n  \\"How can I follow a Kosher diet with easy access to healthy foods in 