."], "language_code": "en-KE", "avg_time_taken": 1.799616140127182, "task_parent_id": "1ebd2545-74f3-41ff-8a5c-6171ad998ea7", "audio_gen_model": "Azure Speech", "image_gen_model": "flux", "generated_queries": "[\\n  \\"What are some popular Luo dishes from Kisumu that are suitable for someone with lactose intolerance and type 2 diabetes?\\",\\n  \\"Where can I find healthy food markets or stores in urban Kisumu with good lactose-free options?\\",\\n  \\"Are there Luo-inspired meal plans for an atheistic, urban male administrator who manages diabetes type 2 with both medication and lifestyle changes?\\",\\n  \\"How can I balance my weekly Ohangla dancing and exercise routine with my diabetes management in the context of Kisumuâ€™s urban lifestyle?\\",\\n  \\"What are the best physical activity venues or community groups in Kisumu for adults 35-44 who enjoy dancing and social exercise?\\",\\n  \\"Are there any local Kisumu or Luo community resources or support groups for men managing type 2 diabetes?\\",\\n  \\"How can I reduce weekly tobacco and alcohol use while maintaining my social life in Kisumuâ€™s urban Luo culture?\\",\\n  \\"What are simple, culturally relevant, lactose-free breakfast options available in Kisumu for busy working adults with diabetes?\\",\\n  \\"How does the availability of healthy foods in Kisumuâ€™s urban areas impact daily meal planning for someone in my age group and occupation?\\",\\n  \\"Are there any Luo traditional herbs or foods from Kisumu that are safe to include in a diabetes-friendly diet while on insulin and oral medication?\\",\\n  \\"What are practical ways for urban Luo men with family support to stay motivated for diabetes care, physical activity, and eating healthily?\\",\\n  \\"Where do most urban professionals in Kisumu go for regular diabetes management check-ups, and what services do they offer for people on both medication and lifestyle management?\\"\\n]", "relevant_profile_info": "Relevant persona fields: Type 2 Diabe