 to focus on eating regularly. Balanced nutrition will make a difference). A subtle, supportive background – a gentle, melodic chime.", "Sound of Liyabona sighing, followed by the rustling of packaging as he grabs a sweetroll. A frustrated grumble in isiXhosa: ‘Yebo, ngiyazithinta. Kufuneka ndiqeqele.’ (Yes, I’m struggling. I need to change).  The market sounds fade slightly in the background, emphasizing his isolation.", "Sound of a bustling market, but with a noticeable sense of calm and purpose in Liyabona’s voice as he speaks isiXhosa: ‘Ngiyabonga, Dr. Zola. Ndizaqeqela ukuzibophelela.’ (Thank you, Dr. Zola. I will make an effort). The sounds of the market blend with the rhythmic beat of traditional music, suggesting a feeling of renewed energy and accomplishment."], "image_prompts": ["Liyabona Ndumiso, a young isiXhosa man, stands in a bustling rural market in the Eastern Cape, South Africa, surrounded by crates of ripe mangoes. He wears a simple, worn shirt and trousers, and has a focused expression as he carefully selects the fruit. The market stall is filled with colorful produce and other goods, and the background shows other vendors and customers. The lighting is bright and warm, emphasizing the vibrant colors of the market. He is holding a handful of peanuts.", "Liyabona Ndumiso sits in a simple, slightly worn examination room at a rural health clinic. Dr. Zola, a kind-faced healthcare worker, is speaking to him with a gentle expression. A chart displaying blood sugar readings is visible on the wall. The room is clean but basic, with a window letting in natural light. Liyabona has a slightly worried but attentive expression. ", "Liyabona Ndumiso is shown standing outside his small business stall at the market, looking frustrated and holding a half-eaten sweetroll. The market is busy with activity, but he appears isolated and disheartened. The lighting is slightly overcast, reflecting his mood. He is wearing a slightly stained shirt, and his posture is slumped.", "Liyabona Ndumiso is shown smiling confidently as he arranges his mangoes at the market stall. He’s wearing a clean shirt, and the stall is well-stocked. The market is lively and busy, but he seems energetic and in control. The lighting is bright and cheerful, and there’s a sense of accomplishment in his posture."], "language_code": "en-ZA", "avg_time_taken": 9.697208734659048, "task_parent_id": "", "audio_gen_model": "Azure Speech", "image_gen_model": "flux", "generated_queries": "[\\n  \\"What are some healthy snack options available in rural Eastern Cape that are both kosher and suitable for someone with type 2 diabetes?\\",\\n  \\"How can young isiXhosa men practicing traditional dancing like umxhentso adjust their diet to better manage diabetes and anxiety?\\",\\n  \\"What mental health support services are accessible in rural Eastern Cape for young male business owners with limited personal support?\\",\\n  \\"How does regular smoking affect diabetes management for young adults in small rural South African communities?\\",\\n  \\"Are there examples of traditional Xhosa snacks that are healthy, kosher, and diabetes-friendly?\\",\\n  \\"What are the best ways for a busy, rural-based business owner in the Eastern Cape to fit exercise into a very limited weekly schedule?\\",\\n  \\"How can I maintain insulin and oral medication routines when running a business in a rural area with only a local clinic for healthcare?\\",\\n  \\"What local resources exist in rural Eastern Cape for young adults without family nearby who want to connect with other Catholics for support?\\",\\n  \\"Are there community initiatives or groups in Eastern Cape rural communities that support physical activity for men aged 18–24?\\",\\n  \\"How do religious and cultural dietary preferences, like being both Roman Catholic and isiXhosa, impact healthy eating with type 2 diabetes in the Eastern Cape?\\",\\n  \\"What rural South African foods should be avoided or included for someone who smokes and has type 2 diabetes?\\",\\n  \\"How often should someone with my profile (young male, isiXhosa, rural, business owner, diabetic, smoker, kosher diet) safely snack during the day to maintain good blood sugar levels?\\"\\n]", "relevant_profile_info": "", "selected_profile_info": [null, "city_town", "religion", "name", "gender", "age", "describe_location", "describe_food", "disability", "occupation", "daily_routine", "hobbies", "activities", "health_conditions", "medication", "healthcare_resources", "healthcare_access", "healthcare_frequency", "culture", "t2d_status", "tobacco", "alcohol", "physical_activity", "diet_restrictions", "support_network", "Question", "generated_queries", "Category", "study_number", "health_goals", "output_format", "label", "story_arc", "type", "parent", "output_tone"]}
0864248a-9a3a-4a1d-8ce6-d9849e6dd8b8	e321ff7d-3b01-4a85-b816-000000006000			<div>\n    <div class="mt-6">\n\n        <div class="overflow-x-auto border rounded-lg">\n            <table class="w-full text-left text-xs">\n                <thead class="bg-slate-50 font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase">\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class="p-2 border-b">Column</th>\n                        <th class="p-2 border-b">Value</th>\n                    </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100">\n                    \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">None</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">40</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Which province do you live in? (select 1)</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">Eastern Cape</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">What is your religion?</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">Christianity (African Independent Churches)</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Name</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">Lulama Ndzendze</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Gender  (select 1)</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">Female</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Age (select 1)</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">25–34</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">How would you describe your local community or area?    (select all that apply)</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">Suburban (near city or town)</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                 