ount}\\n\\n- **Paragraph 3:**\\n  The persona attempts the advice but struggles with **adjusting routines**.\\n  A minor setback occurs due to habit change.\\n  They persist because of the upcoming larger task.\\n  {max_word_count}\\n\\n- **Paragraph 4:**\\n  Gradual, realistic improvement occurs.\\n  The larger task is accomplished with more confidence.\\n  The persona becomes open to continued health improvement.\\n  {max_word_count}", "language": "en", "story_arc": "iteration", "audio_prompts": [], "image_prompts": ["Siphosethu Mbenge, a tired-looking 20-year-old man, sitting at a desk, surrounded by papers and books, with a snack bag open in front of him, showing unhealthy snacks like chips and sweets.", "Siphosethu Mbenge, a 20-year-old man, sitting in a doctor's office, looking at a chart with his doctor, who is smiling and explaining something to him.", "Siphosethu Mbenge, a 20-year-old man, sitting at a desk, looking at a calendar, with a cup of coffee and a sandwich in front of him, showing a mix of healthy and unhealthy foods.", "Siphosethu Mbenge, a 20-year-old man, standing in a bright and colorful traditional umxhentso dancing outfit, with a confident expression, looking out at the camera."], "language_code": "en-ZA", "avg_time_taken": 5.941606560061055, "task_parent_id": "", "audio_gen_model": "Azure Speech", "image_gen_model": "flux", "generated_queries": "[\\n  \\"What are some easy-to-make, lactose-free, healthy snacks that are common in the Eastern Cape, especially in suburban areas near East London or Mthatha?\\",\\n  \\"As a young Xhosa male teacher in the Eastern Cape practicing traditional dancing like umxhentso, how can I manage my type 2 diabetes while maintaining high energy for both work and dance activities?\\",\\n  \\"Are there local, affordable places or supermarkets in suburban Eastern Cape where I can buy healthy foods suitable for diabetes-friendly snacks?\\",\\n  \\"What traditional Xhosa snacks are both lactose-free and suitable for someone with type 2 diabetes who also wants to avoid processed foods?\\",\\n  \\"How can I balance weekly tobacco smoking with my goals for better diabetes management and regular physical activity?\\",\\n  \\"What support groups or diabetic education programs are available for young adults in suburban Eastern Cape, especially for male teachers or Christians (Apostolic)?\\",\\n  \\"How often should I include snacking as part of my meal plan when I am exercising 5-7 days a week and using insulin for diabetes control?\\",\\n  \\"Are there culturally adapted meal plans or snack ideas for IsiXhosa people with lactose intolerance and diabetes living in the Eastern Cape?\\",\\n  \\"What is the impact of participating in physical activities like umxhentso on blood sugar levels for type 2 diabetics in their early 20s?\\",\\n  \\"Where can I find guidance from a local dietitian in the Eastern Cape who understands both diabetes and cultural food preferences for IsiXhosa people?\\",\\n  \\"Are there community initiatives or events in the suburban areas of the Eastern Cape that promote healthy snacking and diabetes awareness among young adults?\\",\\n  \\"How does the Apostolic Christian faith influence dietary practices or recommended snacks during church gatherings for young men with type 2 diabetes in South Africa?\\"\\n]", "relevant_profile_info": "", "selected_profile_info": [null, "city_town", "religion", "name", "gender", "age", "describe_location", "describe_food", "disability", "occupation", "daily_routine", "hobbies", "activities", "health_conditions", "medication", "healthcare_resources", "healthcare_access", "healthcare_frequency", "culture", "t2d_status", "tobacco", "alcohol", "physical_activity", "diet_restrictions", "support_network", "Question", "generated_queries", "Category", "study_number", "health_goals", "output_format", "label", "story_arc", "type", "parent", "output_tone"]}
1681fb36-033f-41dc-ae50-9d65a250adda	e321ff7d-3b01-4a85-b816-000000006000			<div>\n    <div class="mt-6">\n\n        <div class="overflow-x-auto border rounded-lg">\n            <table class="w-full text-left text-xs">\n                <thead class="bg-slate-50 font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase">\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class="p-2 border-b">Column</th>\n                        <th class="p-2 border-b">Value</th>\n                    </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100">\n                    \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">None</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">40</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Which province do you live in? (select 1)</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">Eastern Cape</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">What is your religion?</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">Christianity (Lutheran)</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Name</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">Bongiwe Mabuza</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Gender  (select 1)</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">Female</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Age (select 1)</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">65+</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">How would you describe your local community or area?    (select all that apply)</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">Suburban (near city or town)</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-