lt woman, stands in her small backyard, holding a half-empty watering can loosely at her side. The early morning sun casts soft light over her short-sleeved top and faded jeans. The background shows a tidy vegetable garden and a wire fence with one visibly sagging post. Her shoulders sag slightly, and she looks down at the watering can with a tired, uncertain expression. Close-up candid shot, rich garden textures, morning shadows, natural sunlight on skin and plants.", "Nurse Lydia, middle-aged woman, sits across from Amara Odhiambo in a bright, crowded local clinic room. Wide shot. Papers and posters decorate the pale green walls. Amara sits on the clinic bench, arms crossed, glancing aside as the nurse speaks gently, hands open. Sunlight streams in from a high window, making the room feel warm. Amara’s posture is hesitant, but she listens, legs tucked up, her sandals touching the tiled floor.", "Amara Odhiambo carries two plastic water buckets across her backyard. Medium shot. She walks past the shed, wearing an old t-shirt and track pants. Her arms are extended, face scrunched up in determination, but her shoulders are tense from effort. The buckets swing slightly as she tries to walk faster. The late morning sun gives a sharp contrast, casting clear shadows of Amara and buckets on the ground.", "Amara Odhiambo stands next to the newly repaired farm gate, her hand resting confidently on the top rail. Medium shot. She wears sturdy shoes, casual work clothes with dirt smudges, and she’s smiling with her back straight. The sky is blue overhead, and a few goats graze nearby in the background. The midday sun creates crisp shadows and strong highlights, adding a sense of warmth and achievement."], "language_code": "en-KE", "avg_time_taken": 13.360660791397095, "task_parent_id": "", "audio_gen_model": "Azure Speech", "image_gen_model": "flux", "generated_queries": "[\\n  \\"What are the best exercise routines for women aged 25-34 with type 2 diabetes living in suburban 