h risks?\\",\\n  \\"What exercise facilities, safe walking paths, or group activities exist for young women in rural areas near Maputo?\\",\\n  \\"How do Islamic dietary practices during Ramadan affect insulin management for women with diabetes in Maputo?\\",\\n  \\"What are the most common barriers faced by nurses in rural Mozambique when encouraging patients to exercise regularly?\\",\\n  \\"Are there effective strategies or local resources to reduce daily tobacco and alcohol use among young female healthcare workers in rural Mozambique?\\"\\n]", "relevant_profile_info": "Campos relevantes do perfil da persona: rotina (trabalhadora, enfermeira jovem), responsabilidades de trabalho (cuida de pacientes, faz voluntariado comunitário), limitações de conhecimento sobre saúde (não sabe bem que snacks escolher, ou com que frequência comer para ajudar sua diabetes), acesso regular ao clínico local, dieta halal, acesso limitado a alimentos saudáveis, resistência ao conselho médico, tabagismo diário, hábito de petiscar, apoios familiares, reside em comunidade rural em Maputo.", "selected_profile_info": [null, "city_town", "religion", "name", "gender", "age", "describe_location", "describe_food", "disability", "occupation", "daily_routine", "hobbies", "activities", "health_conditions", "medication", "healthcare_resources", "healthcare_access", "healthcare_frequency", "culture", "t2d_status", "tobacco", "alcohol", "physical_activity", "diet_restrictions", "support_network", "Question", "generated_queries", "Category", "study_number", "health_goals", "output_format", "label", "story_arc", "type", "parent", "output_tone"]}
