ivity are culturally appropriate and feasible for middle-aged female cassava farmers in rural Mozambique who only have time for exercise 1–2 days per week?\\",\\n  \\"Are there tips for reducing the cost of weekly groceries in X - Maputo, especially for someone who enjoys participating in traditional ceremonies involving food and drink?\\",\\n  \\"What are the common challenges rural women in Maputo province face in maintaining a healthy diet for diabetes, and how do they overcome them while keeping cultural traditions alive?\\"\\n]", "relevant_profile_info": "", "selected_profile_info": [null, "city_town", "religion", "name", "gender", "age", "describe_location", "describe_food", "disability", "occupation", "daily_routine", "hobbies", "activities", "health_conditions", "medication", "healthcare_resources", "healthcare_access", "healthcare_frequency", "culture", "t2d_status", "tobacco", "alcohol", "physical_activity", "diet_restrictions", "support_network", "Question", "generated_queries", "Category", "study_number", "health_goals", "output_format", "label", "story_arc", "type", "parent", "output_tone"]}
f2f40826-990b-4791-833f-c821bd12cc20	e321ff7d-3b01-4a85-b815-000000006000			<div>\n    <div class="mt-6">\n\n        <div class="overflow-x-auto border rounded-lg">\n            <table class="w-full text-left text-xs">\n                <thead class="bg-slate-50 font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase">\n                    <tr>\n                        <th class="p-2 border-b">Column</th>\n                        <th class="p-2 border-b">Value</th>\n                    </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100">\n                    \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">None</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">40</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Em qual província você vive? (selecione 1)</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">Maputo</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Qual é a sua religião?</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">Non-religious spirituality</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Nome</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">Premio Manhique</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Gênero (selecione 1)</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">Male</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Idade (selecione 1)</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">18–24</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Como você descreveria sua comunidade ou área local? (selecione todos os que se aplicam)</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">Suburban (near city or town)</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Como você descreveria o acesso a alimentos em sua comunidade ou área local? (selecione todos os que se aplicam)</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">Easy access to healthy foods</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Você tem alguma deficiência? (selecione todos os que se aplicam)</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">I do not have a disability</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Qual é a sua ocupação atual?</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">Subsistence farmer</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">O que melhor descreve sua rotina diária atualmente?</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">Working adult</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Quais hobbies ou interesses você pratica regularmente? (selecione todos os que se aplicam)</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">Football (soccer)</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Quais atividades ou rotinas são mais importantes para você?</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">Exercise or physical activities</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Você possui atualmente outras condições de saúde além do diabetes? (selecione todas as que se aplicam)</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">None of the above</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Você está atualmente tomando medicamentos ou seguindo algum tratamento para diabetes?</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">Insulin injections, B — Oral medication (e.g., Metformin), C — Lifestyle changes only (no medication), D — Herbal or traditional medicine</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Que tipo de recursos de saúde você acessa ou utiliza regularmente?</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">Local healthcare clinic or hospital</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Você tem acesso regular a serviços de saúde?</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">Yes</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Com que frequência você acessa serviços de saúde? (escolha 1)</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">Regularly (at least once a year)</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Cultura (selecione todos os que se aplicam)</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">Rhonga</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Você está atualmente vivendo com Diabetes Tipo 2?</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">Yes</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Você fuma produtos de tabaco?</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">No</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Você consome bebidas alcoólicas?</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">Yes</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Quantos dias por semana você pratica atividade física de intensidade moderada a vigorosa? (escolha 1)</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">3–4 days</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Selecione quaisquer preferências ou restrições alimentares que você possa ter (escolha 1)</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">Kosher</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Quem faz parte da sua rede regular de apoio? (selecione todos os que se aplicam)</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">Healthcare provider or counsellor</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Número do Estudo</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">f2f40826-990b-4791-833f-c821bd12cc20</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                <tr>\n                    <td class="p-2 font-bold">Quais são seus principais objetivos pessoais de saúde? (você pode selecionar mais de um)</td>\n                    <td class="p-2">I don&#x27;t have a gym—what can I do at home or with everyday items to stay active?</td>\n                </tr>\n            \n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n     \n    <style>\n            .guideline-html-content h1 {\n                font-size: 1.1rem;\n                font-weight: 800;\n                margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n            }\n\n            .guideline-html-content h2 {\n                font-size: 1rem;\n                font-weight: 700;\n                margin-bottom: 0.4rem;\n                margin-top: 1rem;\n            }\n\n            .guideline-html-content h3 {\n                font-size: 0.9rem;\n                font-weight: 600;\n                margin-bottom: 0.3rem;\n                margin-top: 0.8rem;\n            }\n\n            .guideline-html-content p {\n                margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n            }\n\n            .guideline-html-content ul,\n            .guideline-html-content ol {\n                margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n                padding-left: 1.25rem;\n            }\n\n            .guideline-html-content li {\n                margin-bottom: 0.2rem;\n            }\n\n            .guideline-html-content strong {\n                font-weight: 700;\n                color: #1e293b;\n            }\n        </style> </div> 	Todos os dias, acordo cedo para trabalhar na minha horta. Como xima com um pouco de frango grelhado e meus legumes, mas não sei se isso ajuda meu diabetes. Certa manhã, senti minha energia baixa e mãos tremendo quando tentava carregar as sacas de milho, e acabei deixando cair parte da carga. Será que eu devia ter prestado mais atenção na minha saúde? Às vezes, eu penso que sou forte demais para me preocupar com essas coisas, então continuo no meu ritmo mesmo sem cuidar direito do corpo.\n\nUm dia, na clínica local, a enfermeira me explicou a importância de exercícios simples que posso fazer em casa usando o que tenho, como agachar com o peso das garrafas de água ou subir e descer degraus perto da minha casa. Ela também disse para eu prestar atenção no meu açúcar no sangue antes e depois dos exercícios. No começo, achei que era muita coisa nova e fiquei inseguro, perguntando: 'Mas será que isso vai realmente ajudar?'. Mesmo assim, decidi tentar, porque quero conseguir trabalhar melhor e não falhar na colheita.\n\nNo começo, não foi fácil mudar meus hábitos. Tentei fazer os exercícios, mas esquecia de medir meu açúcar. Um dia, senti-me cansado demais e pensei em desistir, voltando para os velhos hábitos. Mas lembrei da dica da enfermeira e do meu plano de preparar uma boa colheita maior para ajudar a família. Então, com calma, fui ajustando o meu jeito, fazendo pequenas caminhadas depois do trabalho e usando as garrafas como peso para fortalecer os braços. A cada dia, me sentia um pouco melhor, mesmo com dificuldades no caminho.\n\nCom mais prática, comecei a perceber que consigo trabalhar com mais força e menos cansaço. A colheita maior saiu como planejei, e meus amigos até notaram que estou mais ativo e com mais energia para jogar futebol nos finais de semana. Agora, já entendo que para continuar assim preciso manter os exercícios simples e cuidar da alimentação, usando os alimentos que gosto e posso encontrar no mercado aqui perto. Estou aberto a aprender mais e sei que minha saúde pode melhorar se eu continuar nesse caminho.	{https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/images/official/f2f40826-990b-4791-833f-c821bd12cc20_0.png,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/images/official/f2f40826-990b-4791-833f-c821bd12cc20_1.png,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/images/official/f2f40826-990b-4791-833f-c821bd12cc20_2.png,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/images/official/f2f40826-990b-4791-833f-c821bd12cc20_3.png}	{https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/audios/official/f2f40826-990b-4791-833f-c821bd12cc20_0.mp3,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/audios/official/f2f40826-990b-4791-833f-c821bd12cc20_1.mp3,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/audios/official/f2f40826-990b-4791-833f-c821bd12cc20_2.mp3,https://prxquaevkggpwryikieg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/audios/official/f2f40826-990b-4791-833f-c821bd12cc20_3.mp3}	Não tenho ginásio — o que posso fazer em casa ou com objetos do dia a dia para me manter ativo?	exercise	male	overlapped	2026-03-23 14:15:24.962687+00	{"label": "EXCELLENT", "model": "gpt-4.1-mini", "prompt": "Our persona has the following profile: Candido Nhantumbo is a 65+ year old, \\nCulture: Rhonga male. \\nType 2 Diabetes status: Yes. he is a Subsistence farmer, lives in a Rural (small community or countryside) in Maputo. Disability: he has none. Religion: Christianity (Presbyterian). Daily routine: Working adult. Hobbies: Storytelling. Activities: Socialising with family or friends. Currently taking Medication?: Insulin injections, B — Oral medication (e.g., Metformin), C — Lifestyle changes only (no medication), D — Herbal or traditional medicine. Regular healthcare access: Yes. how often: Occasionally (less than once a year). Health resources accessed: Local healthcare clinic or hospital. Other Healthcare conditions: Hypertension (high blood pressure). Diet restrictions: Halal. Smoking: No. Alcohol drinking: No. Physical activity: 3–4 days. Support network: I live alone or have limited support. Health goals: I don't have a gym—what can I do at home or with everyday items to stay active?. his food access Limited access to healthy foods. Tone of the output: default.\\n\\nUsing the profile of Candido Nhantumbo and understanding the persona's needs (\\"I sometimes eat late at night. How does this affect my blood sugar, and what can I do instead? \\"), identify the most relevant information of the persona's profile that can be leveraged to create an engaging story aimed at inspiring behavior change. List of relevant fields.\\nThen, Generate a five-paragraph health story written in Portuguese that centers around the needs of our persona, which is based on the following question: I sometimes eat late at night. How does this affect my blood sugar, and what can I do instead? . \\n Use spoken Portuguese, story-telling style, rhetorical question, with simple primary school vocabulary.  \\nThe story will have a small work task that foreshadows a larger work task. This will serve as external motivation for the persona to make health changes. The generated story should be in a default tone.\\n\\nUse only this medical ground truth to inform all story decisions and outcomes: \\n<start medical ground truth> \\n \\n<end medical ground truth> \\n\\nUse only this cultural ground truth to inform all story decisions and outcomes: \\n<start cultural ground truth> \\n \\n<end cultural ground truth> \\n\\nOutput Requirements\\n- Return only paragraphs written entirely in Portuguese.\\n- story should first person account\\n- Do not include explanations or any other language.\\n- All story paragraphs must be in Portuguese.\\n- The image prompts should be written entirely in English.\\n\\n\\n- **Paragraph 0:** Select persona fields related to routine, work responsibilities, and basic health knowledge gaps.\\n\\n- **Paragraph 1:**\\n  Introduce daily life and diet habits that reflect **limited awareness** of how health affects work.\\n  The small work task fails due to misunderstanding or neglect of health needs.\\n\\n- **Paragraph 2:**\\n  Help comes from a **formal health source** (clinic or health worker).\\n  Resistance is mild and based on uncertainty.\\n  Advice is clear, simple, personalized, culturally relevant, actionable, and practical.\\n  {max_word_count}\\n\\n- **Paragraph 3:**\\n  The persona attempts the advice but struggles with **adjusting routines**.\\n  A minor setback occurs due to habit change.\\n  They persist because of the upcoming larger task.\\n  {max_word_count}\\n\\n- **Paragraph 4:**\\n  Gradual, realistic improvement occurs.\\n  The larger task is accomplished with more confidence.\\n  The persona becomes open to continued health improvement.\\n  {max_word_count}", "language": "pt", "story_arc": "resistance", "audio_prompts": ["Sounds of light morning breeze rustling leaves and distant roosters crowing around a modest farm. Premio Manhique's voice, mid-range natural pitch and moderate speed, speaks with a slightly resistant and reflective tone explaining how he struggled with energy and managing his diabetes while working. Footsteps on dry soil and occasional distant bird calls create spacious rural ambiance. Premio's breathing is steady but with a hint of tiredness.", "Inside a softly lit clinic, the gentle hum of fluorescent lights and faint murmur of other conversations in the background. Female nurse's warm, clear voice gently instructing Premio Manhique on home exercises, while Premio's voice responds with hesitant but curious questions. Slight pauses as Premio processes information, subtle sounds of papers shuffling and water bottles placed on the table. Voices are captured in medium proximity, natural and unforced.", "Ambient sounds of a quiet suburban backyard with faint bird chirps and distant urban noise. Premio Manhique's breathing is heavier and speech slower, showing effort and mild frustration as he describes challenges doing exercises at home. Occasional soft thuds of water bottles being lifted or set down. Voice captures persistence mixed with momentary fatigue, nearby sound perspective.", "Outdoor street sounds with gentle wind, children laughing and playing football in the distance. Premio Manhique's voice is clearer, more confident and warmer, sharing his success and growing motivation. Footsteps on dusty ground, casual chatter of a friend nearby with a relaxed male voice, creating a friendly conversational ambiance. Voices blend naturally with the environment, wide soundstage."], "image_prompts": ["Premio Manhique standing in his suburban Maputo farmyard at dawn, wearing work clothes with hands holding a sack of maize that is partially dropped, his posture showing fatigue and subtle frustration. Surroundings include modest brick walls, dry earth, and scattered farming tools. The morning light casts soft shadows on his determined but tired face, medium shot.", "Premio Manhique listening attentively to a female nurse in a small local clinic consultation room, the nurse explaining exercises using water bottles placed on a table. Premio's eyebrows are slightly raised, arms crossed hesitantly, showing mild uncertainty but openness. Clinic interior includes posters on diabetes care, bright fluorescent lighting, and a simple desk, medium shot.", "Premio Manhique at home in a small backyard in Maputo, attempting squats using filled water bottles as weights, brow furrowed in concentration but also showing subtle signs of fatigue. The background reveals a worn fence, a clothesline with garments, and late afternoon sun creating warm light and shadows, medium shot.", "Premio Manhique smiling and walking confidently in a dusty suburban street near his home with a friend, both wearing casual clothes. Premio's posture is upright, hands relaxed by his sides, showing renewed energy and confidence. The environment includes small houses with tin roofs, children playing football in the distance, golden hour lighting, wide shot."], "language_code": "pt-PT", "avg_time_taken": 3.6766370713710783, "task_parent_id": "", "audio_gen_model": "Azure Speech", "image_gen_model": "flux", "generated_queries": "[\\n  \\"What are effective home-based exercises for young male adults with type 2 diabetes living in suburban Maputo with no gym access?\\",\\n  \\"How can I use common household items for physical activity routines suitable for a subsistence farmer in the Maputo province?\\",\\n  \\"What are examples of Rhonga-influenced traditional diets in Maputo that are both Halal and suitable for diabetes management?\\",\\n  \\"Where can I find group football (soccer) activities or community games for 18–24 year olds in suburban areas near Maputo city?\\",\\n  \\"Are there any local Rhonga sports or physical activities that help with diabetes control for young adults?\\",\\n  \\"What are affordable, healthy Halal food options commonly available in suburban Maputo near local markets?\\",\\n  \\"How do young, non-religious spiritual men in Maputo balance subsistence farming, diabetes management, and physical activity?\\",\\n  \\"What are the best practices for medication management (insulin, metformin, herbal medicine) in Mozambique for type 2 diabetes patients?\\",\\n  \\"Are there Maputo-based counseling or support resources for young adult male diabetics focusing on lifestyle and spiritual well-being?\\",\\n  \\"What strategies do subsistence farmers in suburban Mozambique use to stay fit when they can't access gyms?\\",\\n  \\"How can I modify football (soccer) training at home for better diabetes control within a suburban Maputo setting?\\",\\n  \\"What are common barriers for suburban Rhonga youth with diabetes to maintaining regular exercise, and how can these be overcome locally?\\"\\n]", "relevant_profile_info": "Rotina diária: Trabalho como agricultor de subsistência em Maputo suburbano, cuidando da pequena horta na minha terra. Estou entre 18 e 24 anos, e enfrento o diabetes tipo 2, mas ainda sinto dúvidas sobre como gerenciar a doença com o meu trabalho. Minha rotina é agitada, não frequento academia, e às vezes não entendo direito como a saúde influencia no meu rendimento diário no campo.", "selected_profile_info": [null, "city_town", "religion", "name", "gender", "age", "describe_location", "describe_food", "disability", "occupation", "daily_routine", "hobbies", "activities", "health_conditions", "medication", "healthcare_resources", "healthcare_access", "healthcare_frequency", "culture", "t2d_status", "tobacco", "alcohol", "physical_activity", "diet_restrictions", "support_network", "Question", "generated_queries", "Category", "study_number", "health_goals", "output_format", "label", "story_arc", "type", "parent", "output_tone"]}
