etes for women who prefer combining modern and traditional medicine?\\",\\n  \\"How do women in urban Maputo balance religious practices, subsistence farming, and self-care for chronic illnesses like diabetes?\\",\\n  \\"Are there any culturally significant Xichangana foods to avoid or modify if I have hypertension and diabetes?\\"\\n]", "relevant_profile_info": "Campos relevantes: Rotina diária, responsabilidades no trabalho (agricultora de subsistência), rotina alimentar, conhecimentos básicos sobre saúde, acesso regular ao sistema de saúde, uso de insulina e medicação oral, acesso fácil a alimentos saudáveis, participação em atividades físicas, objetivo de saúde: exercícios seguros, restrições alimentares halal.", "selected_profile_info": [null, "city_town", "religion", "name", "gender", "age", "describe_location", "describe_food", "disability", "occupation", "daily_routine", "hobbies", "activities", "health_conditions", "medication", "healthcare_resources", "healthcare_access", "healthcare_frequency", "culture", "t2d_status", "tobacco", "alcohol", "physical_activity", "diet_restrictions", "support_network", "Question", "generated_queries", "Category", "study_number", "health_goals", "output_format", "label", "story_arc", "type", "parent", "output_tone"]}
