ities, and basic health knowledge gaps.\\n\\n- **Paragraph 1:**\\n  Introduce daily life and diet habits that reflect **limited awareness** of how health affects work.\\n  The small work task fails due to misunderstanding or neglect of health needs.\\n\\n- **Paragraph 2:**\\n  Help comes from a **formal health source** (clinic or health worker).\\n  Resistance is mild and based on uncertainty.\\n  Advice is clear, simple, personalized, culturally relevant, actionable, and practical.\\n  {max_word_count}\\n\\n- **Paragraph 3:**\\n  The persona attempts the advice but struggles with **adjusting routines**.\\n  A minor setback occurs due to habit change.\\n  They persist because of the upcoming larger task.\\n  {max_word_count}\\n\\n- **Paragraph 4:**\\n  Gradual, realistic improvement occurs.\\n  The larger task is accomplished with more confidence.\\n  The persona becomes open to continued health improvement.\\n  {max_word_count}", "language": "pt", "story_arc": "social_support", "audio_prompts": ["Ambient market sounds—morning birds, street chatter, distant car horns. Sipho Chauke (slightly low and gravelly, South African English accent, moderate speed, clear) grunts as he lifts a bag, breathes heavily and says under his breath, 'Ai, será que estou a ficar mais fraco?,' then sighs. A faint shuffle of feet and rustling of paper bags near him.", "A female nurse, nearby, speaks clearly in Mozambican Portuguese, explaining healthy snack options. Sipho Chauke responds with hesitant, mid-range tone, slow but clear: 'Eu posso tentar, sim... mas será mesmo que vai ajudar?' The background has soft hospital echoes—pages turning, intercom mumble, a cough in the distance.", "Sipho Chauke is alone in his kitchen, the plastic snap of containers, a crinkly chip bag opening, his footsteps soft on tile. He murmurs to himself in Xichangana-accented Portuguese, frustration in his pacing, voice lower: 'Puxa, quase esqueci...' The background includes faint gospel music from the radio and outside street sounds through an open window.", "Outside in a church parking lot, children's laughter and older women's conversation blends with birdsong. Sipho Chauke’s tone is lively, higher-pitched as he calls out cheerful greetings, louder and more confident with each phrase: 'Vamos lá, subam, está tudo bem!' His laughter echoes, breathing steady, as footsteps and doors closing signal activity around the minibus."], "image_prompts": ["A candid street photo of Sipho Chauke, a Xichangana male minibus driver around 30 years old, standing by his minibus near a busy Maputo city market in the early morning. Sipho is reaching into a plastic bag filled with roasted maize, sweet potatoes, and a peanut bar, wearing an everyday dark t-shirt and faded jeans. His posture is slightly slouched, and his brow is furrowed in mild confusion, glancing towards an elderly passenger's heavy bags on the pavement. The scene is bathed in soft golden sunrise light, with textured urban pavement and colorful market stalls in the background. (medium shot, candid, unposed)", "In this natural clinic setting, Sipho Chauke is sitting upright in a molded blue plastic chair in a sunlit hospital corridor, hands resting on his lap and a skeptical half-smile on his face. Beside him, a female nurse in a crisp white uniform speaks earnestly, holding a pamphlet about healthy vegan snacks and demonstrating portion sizes. A wall chart in Portuguese is visible behind them, and there's a gentle brightness coming from a window. (wide shot, candid, unposed)", "Medium shot. Sipho Chauke, standing in his tidy, modest kitchen, is packing peeled carrots and roasted peanuts into small clear containers; his other hand clutches a large, unopened bag of street-bought chips, hesitating at the counter. His shoulders are hunched; he frowns in self-doubt, his gaze torn between the healthy snacks and the chips. In the background, a small radio and a cross are visible on a shelf, with morning light casting soft yellow rays over the scene.", "At the church parking lot under bright afternoon sun, Sipho Chauke stands next to his clean minibus, energetically helping children and older women to climb inside. He is mid-laugh, arm raised in greeting, posture upright and relaxed, sweat visible on his forehead, but his body shows more confidence and ease. Urban Maputo buildings and a Presbyterian church entrance painted in blue appear in the midground. (medium shot, candid, unposed)"], "language_code": "pt-PT", "avg_time_taken": 1.8214844286441803, "task_parent_id": "", "audio_gen_model": "Azure Speech", "image_gen_model": "flux", "generated_queries": "[\\n  \\"What are some vegan-friendly traditional Xichangana snacks available in Maputo city for someone managing type 2 diabetes and hypertension?\\",\\n  \\"Where can I find healthy vegan snack options near Maputo city markets or supermarkets with easy access for working adults like minibus drivers?\\",\\n  \\"How do Presbyterian community or religious groups in urban Mozambique support members with diabetes in maintaining a healthy diet and lifestyle?\\",\\n  \\"What are the best ways for a 25-34 year old male minibus driver in Maputo to incorporate exercise into a busy daily routine, given he currently doesn’t exercise during the week?\\",\\n  \\"Which herbal or traditional medicines commonly used in Maputo are safe for someone who also uses insulin and metformin for diabetes management?\\",\\n  \\"Are there culturally relevant Xichangana dance events or classes in Maputo that can help increase physical activity for young adults?\\",\\n  \\"What are the recommended serving sizes and frequency for vegan snacks for adults with type 2 diabetes and hypertension living in urban Mozambique?\\",\\n  \\"How can minibus drivers in Maputo prevent unhealthy snacking when on long shifts, and what are some easy-to-carry vegan snack alternatives?\\",\\n  \\"Are there any local Maputo healthcare clinics offering nutrition counseling tailored for diabetic, vegan, and hypertensive patients?\\",\\n  \\"How do urban lifestyles in Maputo affect the risk of hypertension and diabetes among young adult males, and what community resources are available for managing these conditions?\\",\\n  \\"What are the popular vegan street foods or snacks in Maputo that fit a diabetic-friendly and hypertension-conscious diet?\\",\\n  \\"How can traditional Xichangana cultural beliefs influence snack choices and health practices for someone with my health profile in Maputo?\\"\\n]", "relevant_profile_info": "Campos relevantes: rotina diária de trabalho como motorista de minibus; alimentação baseada em snacks rápidos e vegetarianos; falha em manter atividade física regular; acesso fácil a mercados e snacks tradicionais; prática religiosa e apoio comunitário; dúvida sobre como organizar um menu saudável diário e controlar o apetite por snacks.", "selected_profile_info": [null, "city_town", "religion", "name", "gender", "age", "describe_location", "describe_food", "disability", "occupation", "daily_routine", "hobbies", "activities", "health_conditions", "medication", "healthcare_resources", "healthcare_access", "healthcare_frequency", "culture", "t2d_status", "tobacco", "alcohol", "physical_activity", "diet_restrictions", "support_network", "Question", "generated_queries", "Category", "study_number", "health_goals", "output_format", "label", "story_arc", "type", "parent", "output_tone"]}
