tensils. The lighting is warm and slightly dim. Amílcar is clearly thinking about his food.", "Wide shot of Amílcar Mucavele, 41, helping a neighbor, Seu Joaquim, a man in his 60s, build a chicken coop in a rural area near Maputo. Amílcar is carrying wooden planks with a confident stride, smiling. The scene is bathed in golden afternoon light. The texture of the wood and the surrounding vegetation is prominent. Amílcar is looking at Seu Joaquim."], "language_code": "pt-PT", "avg_time_taken": 79.50005376033293, "task_parent_id": "", "audio_gen_model": "Azure Speech", "image_gen_model": "flux", "generated_queries": "[\\n  \\"What traditional Xichangana foods grown in Gaza province are suitable for a healthy diet for men with type 2 diabetes?\\",\\n  \\"How can a subsistence farmer in suburban Gaza, Mozambique use locally available foods to create simple, diabetic-friendly meals?\\",\\n  \\"Are there sample daily menus for adult Xichangana males with easy access to fresh produce who also use both insulin and oral diabetes medication?\\",\\n  \\"What are examples of healthy breakfast, lunch, and dinner options for a 35–44-year-old male with type 2 diabetes following Xichangana food customs?\\",\\n  \\"How do Xichangana Presbyterian communities in Gaza province balance traditional meals with diabetes management?\\",\\n  \\"Can you suggest traditional Mozambican dishes from the Gaza region that align with lifestyle changes for diabetes control?\\",\\n  \\"What impact does traditional dancing as a hobby have on blood sugar management for adults with type 2 diabetes in Mozambique?\\",\\n  \\"What seasonal fruits and vegetables available in Gaza province are best for a diabetic-friendly diet?\\",\\n  \\"Are there any culturally respected herbal or traditional medicines used in Xichangana communities for managing type 2 diabetes, and how should they be combined with prescribed medications?\\",\\n  \\"How does easy access to healthy foods in suburban Gaza influence meal planning for diabetic men with active family support?\\",\\n  \\"What barriers might a working subsistence farmer in semi-urban Gaza face in maintaining regular physical activity, and how can these be overcome?\\",\\n  \\"Are there community programs or group activities in the Presbyterian church in Gaza that support diabetes-friendly eating or exercises for middle-aged men?\\"\\n]", "relevant_profile_info": "", "selected_profile_info": ["city_town", "name", "gender", "age", "disability", "occupation", "hobbies", "medication", "healthcare_access", "healthcare_frequency", "tobacco", "physical_activity", "Question", "generated_queries", "Category", "study_number", "health_goals", "output_format", "label", "story_arc", "type", "parent", "output_tone"]}
